@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_24_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:第二天中午，<br>我独自一人前往招待所。|#0204Adv11_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:趁着早晨的放风时间，我去了仓库，<br>将冰镐、御寒用品<br>以及应急食品塞进包里，做好了万全的准备。|#0204Adv11_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed

[PrintTextModified Text:（这次一定要查明真相！）|#0204Adv11_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:怀揣着坚定的决心，<br>正准备出发时。|#0204Adv11_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 駆け足SE
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_173 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0
@Wait WaitMode:1

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:——希罗！|#0204Adv11_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Angry1

[PrintTextModified Text:听见背后传来声音，我回头一看，<br>蕾雅、雪莉、汉娜，还有米莉亚<br>正朝着我跑来。|#0204Adv11_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:她们每个人都和我一样带着包。|#0204Adv11_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:你们怎么来了……有什么事？|#0204Adv11_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Miria
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Sherry

[PrintTextModified Text:从早餐的时候开始，大家就在讨论说，<br>希罗看起来状态有点不对。|#0204Adv11_Hanna001| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:看上去像是一个人<br>背负了什么重任……|#0204Adv11_Miria001| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请不要独自烦恼！<br>我们可是同伴啊！|#0204Adv11_Sherry001| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗一连好几天都在调查地下，<br>这件事我们大家都知道。|#0204Adv11_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:今天你也要去调查地下吧？<br>我们也一起——|#0204Adv11_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 手をはらう音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_18 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:蕾雅向我靠近并伸出手，<br>我却不由自主地挥开了。|#0204Adv11_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:出于尴尬，<br>我不敢正视蕾雅的脸。|#0204Adv11_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:不要靠近我。我自己一个人解决。|#0204Adv11_Hiro003| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，你到底是——|#0204Adv11_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:你们都是累赘！<br>一发生凶杀案就把我当成凶手，<br>从一开始到现在都只会妨碍我……！|#0204Adv11_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆苦しそうに

[PrintTextModified Text:别再靠近我了！<br>你们这些……肮脏的、魔女……！|#0204Adv11_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:为了让她们远离自己，<br>我故意选择了最恶毒的话语。|#0204Adv11_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而，这些恶毒的话<br>也深深刺痛着自己。|#0204Adv11_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; 倒れるSE
@SpawnShake ActorId:Camera ShakeCount:2 ShakeAmplitude:0.1 AmplitudeVariation:0.15

[PrintTextModified Text:话音未落，我便支撑不住，单膝跪地。|#0204Adv11_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:呼吸开始急促。<br>思绪混乱，感觉自己的心正逐渐被黑暗吞没。|#0204Adv11_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗，<br>难道你正在加剧魔女化……？|#0204Adv11_Sherry002| AuthorId:Sherry RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:听到这突如其来的低语，<br>我的身体猛然僵硬。|#0204Adv11_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:你、你不会对谁<br>产生了杀意吧……！？|#0204Adv11_Hanna002| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我不是魔女！<br>别拿我跟你们相提并论！！|#0204Adv11_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:40 IdAndAppearance:Sherry
@Wait WaitMode:0.1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hanna
@Wait WaitMode:0.4

[PrintTextModified Text:我抬头怒视，大声喊道。<br>汉娜连忙躲到了雪莉身后。|#0204Adv11_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我努力调整紊乱的呼吸，<br>再次迈步朝招待所走去。|#0204Adv11_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我的理智还在。<br>　我没问题，一定还来得及。）|#0204Adv11_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗不会杀我们的。|#0204Adv11_Leia005| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:即使我那样冷酷拒绝，<br>蕾雅依然跟了上来。|#0204Adv11_Narrative015| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Miria.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:比起独自探索，<br>大家合作一定效率更高……<br>你觉得呢？|#0204Adv11_Miria002| AuthorId:Miria RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Smile1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:70 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:米莉亚、雪莉、汉娜也跟上来了。<br>接着……|#0204Adv11_Narrative016| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ResetText

; 野外を走る音・1人
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_173 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

; ＠備考◆遠くから走ってくる

[PrintTextModified Text:希罗——！大家——！|#0204Adv11_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@StopSfx

; ＠備考◆走った後の息切れ
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:我、我也来帮忙……！|#0204Adv11_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:连艾玛都来了。<br>我深深叹了口气。|#0204Adv11_Narrative017| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Scale:1 Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Smile1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:烧已经退了，头脑也清醒了，<br>我已经病好了。大家一起去调查地下吧！|#0204Adv11_Ema003| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:……随你们便。|#0204Adv11_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:说实话，我害怕有人在身边时，<br>自己会失去自我，彻底失控。|#0204Adv11_Narrative018| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:昨天说出冷酷的话的亚里沙，恐怕也是这么想的。|#0204Adv11_Narrative019| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我不想伤害任何人。<br>　不想杀死任何人……）|#0204Adv11_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙没有出现在这里，<br>想必是害怕自己会将无差别的杀意投向某个人，<br>才刻意回避接近大家的。|#0204Adv11_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:但她们似乎<br>根本无法察觉我内心的纠葛。<br>|#0204Adv11_Narrative021| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我明白，再继续拒绝也无济于事，<br>只能决定接受她们的协助。|#0204Adv11_Narrative022| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.EndAdv

